        "fields": {
          "notes": "Antonovsky's exact 1911 preface identifies a 1900 Edition state in his translation lineage. Current RSL and RNL records now reconcile one exact Saint Petersburg 1900 Antonovsky Edition through a shared rc\\1717107 control core, identical transaction value, and matching bibliography. RSL reports two remote holdings and RNL reports one current holding, 128/318. The current Lithuanian National Library record adds one remote holding, 1.40686, and agrees on title, translation responsibility, place, year, and 624-page main extent, but its [s.n.] and [3], XI description conflicts with the RSL/RNL typography and [4], XII description. The four holdings provide bibliographic coordinates. The Expression remains provisional, uncollated, and unreviewed; acquisition and examination of source pages remain open."
        },
